{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16439","headline":"柳条歌送客 · 刘商","name":"柳条歌送客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露井夭桃春未到，迟日犹寒柳开早。\n高枝低枝飞鹂黄，千条万条覆宫墙。\n几回离别折欲尽，一夜东风吹又长。\n毵毵拂人行不进，依依送君无远近。\n青春去住随柳条，却寄来人以爲信。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}